  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_TYPE has the value 30</p>
  <p>Used to set the type of shape the physics engine should use for the prim. This is primarily used to do <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Physics_Optimization" target="_blank">Physics Optimization</a>.</p>
</p>
